MaxSimulationWallTime_in_Seconds  1.72e9
CpuTimeBetRestartFile             3350
% CONVENTION: on batch systems set TimeLimitCPU (seconds) <~ your SLURM wall-time
%  so GIZMO self-stops gracefully (drains to a phase boundary, writes restart,
%  MPI_Finalize) at 0.85*TimeLimitCPU BEFORE the scheduler hard-kills the job.
%  An external SLURM timeout kill cannot be caught and risks leaving nodes in CG.
%  Left unset here (defaults to 24h) since each run/queue needs its own value.
ParticleNumberMemoryImbalance_Limit 1.9
SofteningHalo                     2.e6
SofteningDisk                     2.e7
SofteningStars                    2.e4
